  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NSPC911/rovr/zipball/v0.10.1.post1",
  "body": "Very quick release, this fixes a regression with the first launch app that doesn't let you finish setup\r\n\r\n## Full Changelog\r\n\r\n### Fixed\r\n\r\n- `preview`: catch EOF error when reading archives [f5b836f](https://github.com/NSPC911/rovr/commit/f5b836f24dc403b4664972bd89dfecce8c13f2cb)\r\n- `firstlaunch`: use assets, not config when reading config [df111f6](https://github.com/NSPC911/rovr/commit/df111f6e5e245ff58603c99493cdec07875c8904)\r\n\r\n### Refactor\r\n\r\n- `app`: print tree without alternate terminal buffer [ee612ff](https://github.com/NSPC911/rovr/commit/ee612ff7b21c6575775405d54bc421a352263cf5)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\n### uv\r\n```shell\r\nuv tool install rovr\r\n```\r\n### 'native' executables\r\nWindows systems:\r\n```pwsh\r\nInvoke-Expression (Invoke-WebRequest \"https://nspc911.github.io/rovr/install.ps1\")\r\n```\r\nNon-Windows systems:\r\n```sh\r\ncurl -fsSL https://nspc911.github.io/rovr/install.sh | bash\r\n```\r\n- The executables are from action run [32371648070](\r\nhttps://github.com/NSPC911/rovr/actions/runs/32371648070)\r\n\r\n### SHA256\r\n| Binary | Hash |\r\n| ------ | ---- |\r\n| rovr-linux-arm64-nuitka.zip | `sha256:DB4249BAAEB5C7FA335E3A23E071FEA59C7F4D27E95741B9E5FCD3D6776DCAB6` |\r\n| rovr-linux-x64-nuitka.zip | `sha256:555BD41A7A5132CADE3FD2FC923E7F3B91D46B34A3F456DE25262686B2E0AC3D` |\r\n| rovr-macos-arm64-nuitka.zip | `sha256:76DCE64A2A384E0B8BC1ADBEB921075971F416B45487B7EBA18FACE5174A6E9A` |\r\n| rovr-macos-x64-nuitka.zip | `sha256:8D650B9F79BB34B1F0BDEFA4C4117F6C778099FD16139DA4A2B8346A0FB30D33` |\r\n| rovr-windows-arm-nuitka.zip | `sha256:34BA4AFB1EF43DB40E0D1FF313B69CEDF7F500AC78A765B936273CB2ABE7B161` |\r\n| rovr-windows-x64-nuitka.zip | `sha256:D2F6418C598DFDFDBE76FA5853AE46C13DA45220860AD0AF7125E34AC642F88F` |\r\n\r\n"
